v class='jdgm-carousel-item__review'\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__review-rating' aria-label='5 stars' role='img'\u003e \u003cspan class='jdgm-star jdgm--on'\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class='jdgm-star jdgm--on'\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class='jdgm-star jdgm--on'\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class='jdgm-star jdgm--on'\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class='jdgm-star jdgm--on'\u003e\u003c/span\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__review-content'\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__review-title'\u003e\u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__review-body'\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe bolognese on this spag bol is the most delicious flavoursome sauce i’ve tasted. Will definitely be ordering more of this!  It’s a yes from the Kids as well ! Yum 😋\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__reviewer-name-wrapper'\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__reviewer-name jdgm-ellipsis'\u003e Marina \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__timestamp jdgm-ellipsis jdgm-spinner' data-time='11/03/2026'\u003e 11/03/2026 \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e  \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__product '\u003e  \u003c/div\u003e  \u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item ' data-review-id='c7feb058-6928-4309-a022-b0a5dd0ff337'\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__review'\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__review-rating' aria-label='5 stars' role='img'\u003e \u003cspan class='jdgm-star jdgm--on'\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class='jdgm-star jdgm--on'\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class='jdgm-star jdgm--on'\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class='jdgm-star jdgm--on'\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class='jdgm-star jdgm--on'\u003e\u003c/span\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__review-content'\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__review-title'\u003e\u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__review-body'\u003e\u003cp\u003eYum!!! quick, easy to grab and delicious for those on-the-go days!!  it all tasted fresh from the wrap, to the salad to the chicken. yum!!\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__reviewer-name-wrapper'\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__reviewer-name jdgm-ellipsis'\u003e Marina \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__timestamp jdgm-ellipsis jdgm-spinner' data-time='11/03/2026'\u003e 11/03/2026 \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e  \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__product '\u003e  \u003c/div\u003e  \u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item ' data-review-id='82e8d5aa-62bb-420f-954b-35d8d66ab511'\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__review'\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__review-rating' aria-label='5 stars' role='img'\u003e \u003cspan class='jdgm-star jdgm--on'\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class='jdgm-star jdgm--on'\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class='jdgm-star jdgm--on'\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class='jdgm-star jdgm--on'\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class='jdgm-star jdgm--on'\u003e\u003c/span\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__review-content'\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__review-title'\u003e\u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__review-body'\u003e\u003cp\u003eHands down the Ready made fresh meal i’ve ever had. Absolutely delicious. Beef was soft and tender just melts in your mouth with the complimenting taste and texture of the sweet potato! 🤤  My favourite so far. Good portion size, not too little, not too heavy. PERFECTION. Sorry i demolished it before taking a photo- heres the proof 🤭\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__reviewer-name-wrapper'\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__reviewer-name jdgm-ellipsis'\u003e Marina \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class='jdgm-carousel-item__ti